          "text": "Lee's going to run a few minutes late so so we can possibly make a start without him. I'm the least qualified person to speak about anything to have SFTP or folders, so I'll just sit in the background and uh yeah, observe. So I don't know, Jack or Harry, if you if you want to start off from where we are on on our side and then just try and"
