          "text": "And Eddie Com's inability to kind of put those into two separate folders."
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 49.574,
          "end": 57.104,
          "text": "I spoke with Harry and the team. Harry's the lead engineer on Fuse, the integration platform we're plugging you guys into."
