          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 106.598,
          "end": 107.28,
          "text": "Much better."
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
          "speaker": 1,
          "start": 132.07,
          "end": 144.496,
          "text": "Yeah, thanks, Harry. So I think the the purpose of the call really wanted to explore what our options are. Obviously, you know, we can go do a more detailed assessment on the fuse side, but I'm conscious we're on tight deadlines here and"
        },
        {
          "channel": "them",
